sequenceDiagram
  participant App as "React PWA"
  participant Local as "本地镜像/outbox"
  participant API as "Fastify API"
  participant DB as "SQLite"

  App->>API: GET /api/archive
  alt 首次启动，服务端未初始化
    App->>API: POST /api/archive/import（已有本地存档）
    API->>DB: 保存命名空间快照并建立结构化投影
  else 已有单人存档
    App->>Local: 读取待同步快照
    Local->>API: PUT /api/archive/:namespace
    API->>DB: 应用最新本地快照
    API-->>App: 返回服务端快照
  end

  App->>API: GET /api/content/passages
  API->>DB: 读取文章版本目录
  DB-->>API: passages
  API-->>App: 替换前端内容目录

  App->>API: POST /api/review/sessions
  API->>DB: 读取 pending review_items
  API->>DB: 创建或恢复 active review_session
  API-->>App: 当前复习组
  App->>App: 本地首字母判定与答错重排
  App->>API: POST /attempts（operationId）
  API->>DB: 幂等记录结果并更新 session/item
  API-->>App: 最新会话状态
